# Golden retrieval judgments for boost's RAG engines.
# One JSON object per line: {query, relevant[], kind, note}
#   query    - what a user might type
#   relevant - skill/rule/workflow name(s) that count as a correct top hit
#   kind     - the target's item kind (for per-kind metric slices)
# Grading is by name; `relevant` is a set, so a query may have >1 right answer.
